; S4: the self-hosted lexer. The generated tables must be current, the
; sources must follow the dialect, and the Pascal compiler built by pcc must
; print exactly the same --emit-tokens output, diagnostics and exit status
; as the C++ pcc for every .pas file in the repository, in both modes.
; (Also run, by hand: the fuzz corpus and iso7185pat.pas; see SELFHOST.md.)
; RUN: python3 %S/../../utils/gen-selfhost-tables.py --check
; RUN: python3 %S/../../utils/selfhost-lint.py %S/../../selfhost/pcsys.pas %S/../../selfhost/pcutil.pas %S/../../selfhost/pcdiag.pas %S/../../selfhost/pclex.pas %S/../../selfhost/pcc.pas
; RUN: %pcc --mode=tp -I %S/../../selfhost %S/../../selfhost/pcc.pas -o %t.pcc
; RUN: python3 %S/../../utils/selfhost-diff.py --ref pcc --new %t.pcc %S/.. %S/../../selfhost | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: runs, 0 differ
